 void StartBuilderPreview(){if(builderRuntime.Count==0)SeedBuilderRuntime();if(!builderPreview)builderLoaded=false;if(builderTimer==null){builderTimer=new DispatcherTimer{Interval=TimeSpan.FromSeconds(1)};builderTimer.Tick+=delegate{if(builderPreview)RunBuilderMockTick();else RefreshBuilderAccessData();};}builderTimer.Start();if(builderPreview)RunBuilderMockTick();else RefreshBuilderAccessData();}
 void RunBuilderMockTick(){RunBuilderProgram();RefreshBuilderAccessData();if(builderConsole!=null){builderConsole.Children.Clear();foreach(var value in builderRuntime.OrderBy(x=>x.Key))builderConsole.Children.Add(BuilderSub(value.Key+" = "+(value.Value is Array?"["+String.Join(", ",((Array)value.Value).Cast<object>())+"]":Convert.ToString(value.Value))));builderConsole.Children.Add(BuilderSub("tick = "+DateTime.Now.ToLongTimeString()));}}

 FrameworkElement BuilderPrefabTab(){var host=new StackPanel{Margin=new Thickness(14)};host.Children.Add(BuilderHeading("Prefabs"));host.Children.Add(BuilderSub("Save a selected UI subtree as a reusable component. Instances retain the prefab id and exposed parameters."));host.Children.Add(BuilderPrimaryButton("add","Create from selected node",CreateBuilderPrefab));var grid=new UniformGrid{Columns=4,Margin=new Thickness(0,14,0,0)};foreach(var prefab in builderProject.prefabs){var p=prefab;var card=new StackPanel();card.Children.Add(BuilderHeading(p.name));card.Children.Add(BuilderSub(p.root==null?"Missing root":p.root.type+" · "+CountBuilderNodes(p.root)+" nodes"));card.Children.Add(BuilderPrimaryButton("edit","Open master",()=>{builderSelected=p.root;builderTab="UI";DrawBuilder();}));card.Children.Add(BuilderPrimaryButton("add","Add instance",()=>AddPrefabInstance(p)));card.Children.Add(BuilderPrimaryButton("expose","Expose root property",()=>ExposeBuilderParam(p)));grid.Children.Add(BuilderPanel(card));}host.Children.Add(grid);return new ScrollViewer{Content=host,VerticalScrollBarVisibility=ScrollBarVisibility.Auto};}
 void CreateBuilderPrefab(){if(builderSelected==null)return;var copy=CloneBuilderNode(builderSelected);builderProject.prefabs.Add(new BuilderPrefab{name=builderSelected.name+" prefab",root=copy});SnapshotBuilder();DrawBuilder();}
 void AddPrefabInstance(BuilderPrefab prefab){var n=NewBuilderNode("prefab_instance");n.name=prefab.name;SetBuilder(n,"prefab_id",prefab.id);builderProject.ui_tree.children.Add(n);SnapshotBuilder();builderTab="UI";builderSelected=n;DrawBuilder();}
 void ExposeBuilderParam(BuilderPrefab prefab){if(prefab.root==null||prefab.root.properties.Count==0)return;var key=prefab.root.properties.Keys.First();prefab.exposed_params.Add(new BuilderPrefabParam{name=key,target_node=prefab.root.id,property=key});SnapshotBuilder();DrawBuilder();}
 int CountBuilderNodes(BuilderNode n){return 1+n.children.Sum(child=>CountBuilderNodes(child));}
 BuilderNode CloneBuilderNode(BuilderNode node){var serializer=new JavaScriptSerializer();return serializer.Deserialize<BuilderNode>(serializer.Serialize(node));}

 void SnapshotBuilder(bool trim=true){if(builderProject==null)return;string json=new JavaScriptSerializer().Serialize(builderProject);if(builderHistoryIndex>=0&&builderHistory[builderHistoryIndex]==json)return;if(trim&&builderHistoryIndex<builderHistory.Count-1)builderHistory.RemoveRange(builderHistoryIndex+1,builderHistory.Count-builderHistoryIndex-1);builderHistory.Add(json);if(builderHistory.Count>60)builderHistory.RemoveAt(0);builderHistoryIndex=builderHistory.Count-1;}
 void UndoBuilder(){if(builderHistoryIndex<=0)return;builderHistoryIndex--;RestoreBuilderSnapshot();}
 void RedoBuilder(){if(builderHistoryIndex>=builderHistory.Count-1)return;builderHistoryIndex++;RestoreBuilderSnapshot();}
 void RestoreBuilderSnapshot(){builderProject=new JavaScriptSerializer().Deserialize<WidgetBuilderProject>(builderHistory[builderHistoryIndex]);builderSelected=builderProject.ui_tree;DrawBuilder();}
 void SaveBuilderProject(string file){if(builderProject==null)return;Directory.CreateDirectory(Path.GetDirectoryName(file));File.WriteAllText(file,Pretty(new JavaScriptSerializer().Serialize(builderProject)));}
 void OpenBuilderProject(){var dialog=new OpenFileDialog{Filter="Widget project|*.json"};if(dialog.ShowDialog(builderWindow)!=true)return;try{var project=new JavaScriptSerializer().Deserialize<WidgetBuilderProject>(File.ReadAllText(dialog.FileName));if(project==null||project.ui_tree==null)throw new Exception("This file does not contain a UI tree.");builderProject=project;builderSelected=project.ui_tree;builderHistory.Clear();builderHistoryIndex=-1;SnapshotBuilder(false);DrawBuilder();}catch(Exception e){MessageBox.Show(builderWindow,e.Message,"Open failed");}}
 void ExportBuilderProject(){ExportWidgetPackage();}
 List<string> ValidateBuilder(){var errors=new List<string>();var ids=new HashSet<string>();Action<BuilderNode> scan=null;scan=n=>{if(!ids.Add(n.id))errors.Add("Duplicate node id: "+n.id);foreach(var p in n.properties.Values)if(!String.IsNullOrEmpty(p.binding)&&p.binding.StartsWith("var:")){string name=p.binding.Substring(4);if(name!="item"&&!builderProject.variables.Any(v=>v.name==name))errors.Add("Unresolved binding: "+p.binding);}if(n.type=="prefab_instance"){string id=BuilderString(n,"prefab_id","");if(!builderProject.prefabs.Any(p=>p.id==id))errors.Add("Missing prefab: "+id);}foreach(var c in n.children)scan(c);};scan(builderProject.ui_tree);foreach(var prefab in builderProject.prefabs)if(prefab.root==null)errors.Add("Prefab has no root: "+prefab.name);foreach(var block in builderProject.logic_graph)if(block.type.StartsWith("events.")&&!String.IsNullOrEmpty(block.next)&&!builderProject.logic_graph.Any(b=>b.id==block.next))errors.Add("Orphaned event graph: "+block.type);return errors.Distinct().ToList();}
} }
